<title>Nigeria: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/nigeria/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-nigeria-2026-10-17T19:38:48.280Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sat, 17 Oct 2026 19:38:48 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Security forces used drones and CCTV to thwart a terrorist attack in Riyom, while gunmen killed a traditional ruler and four vigilantes in Plateau, and also stormed a mining site killing two people. In Zamfara, gunmen killed three police officers during a night patrol and earlier killed three officers in a separate patrol attack. Bandits besieged a Kaduna estate, forcing residents to flee, and abducted a pregnant woman, her husband and their six-month-old daughter, demanding a large ransom. Catholic priest John Otache was abducted in Benue, prompting police deployment for his rescue. The conflict produced 1,486 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisgFBVV95cUxPNDc5aGstcVFvYWxpRlczSEVzOUtWWUxOY3hTWGZZTlBPZDRYcV8zMEJEVDM2cGJlUkc3YmNiYkFJdVFhdzNHUVBIOS1rbmkyUjZOTWo2Y2lhUVNJMUxDd0hUNmtTb3A1S3NOdTB0RHJXcGxiRUd4aU5lU3daUkdUeEx5bE42di0wYzJLMndsbVFwVjVTN21HdVZkOHplRi01bkVIN1BrMkJMSFozX250eWtB?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian Nigeria News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Vanguard News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMidEFVX3lxTE45ekhzX29ldEozT1dlYWhTSjM4R1doV0R2UzU4NktkN0Y0bjNVZnNrMTAwTHJCeXlGRF8tWl95MW9ybnZ6X1VFN2RhX1pJN2kyMGhsbVdEc1BxaFoybU9GU202YTdMTC1PS3JoNnN5eGVOYWhM?oc=5&quot;&gt;Parallel Facts News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMioAFBVV95cUxQX3hJT0o3ZWVmUFNORjRkVVpLaW5zTXctdHZqTk5OQVlMRkR2ZnRjNXpKTDVOOUZlbEo0bXMzOFM5ZEw4aGc0MTctRWFYekNBV21Hc3R5MEhOS0VseWQ3OXZ2UTVSVFZva3FaMFJ2WS1iTzBZYXdNUzlLUEN1RUhKd1NwMWRpelp1UUtUcl9NN1BEb2tRSHJIRUN2aHA0Zy1n?oc=5&quot;&gt;Head Topics&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqgFBVV95cUxQZjBGYkxRVjdUbUlld0VnQUVQQWtMZlNTZFUzSVh1VzVSc3NvQ1UyTFZJQ2VHQ0V5b3JOaEdIeEd0dU1MQ0FsRWRwU2RRTkdSR2R